flowchart TD
  UI[Next App Router pages / shared Finance browser] --> API[Authenticated route handlers]
  API --> Auth[Session / role / calendar capabilities]
  API --> Domain[Finance mutations / support / links / verification]
  API --> Query[Shared Finance queries and reconciliation]
  API --> Lifecycle[Term closure / archive and restore]
  Domain --> Prisma[Prisma MariaDB adapter]
  Query --> Prisma
  Lifecycle --> Prisma
  API --> Storage[Private local or S3 storage]
  API --> OCR[Bounded OCR proxy]
  OCR --> Python[FastAPI / PaddleOCR parser]
